# Local developer overrides (not committed)

Copy `development.json` and set your machine's reachable API origin, e.g.:

```json
{
  "ENV": "development",
  "API_BASE_URL": "http://192.168.1.20:3000",
  "ENABLE_NETWORK_LOGGING": "true"
}
```

Then run:

```bash
flutter run --dart-define-from-file=config/local.json
```

Android emulator → host loopback: `http://10.0.2.2:3000`
iOS simulator → host loopback: `http://127.0.0.1:3000`
Physical device → your LAN IP (never commit personal IPs).
